   181	    /// @notice Queue a self-call, or run it now when `delay` is zero. Refused while `distribute` or
   182	    /// `release` is running.
   183	    /// @param action Calldata for one of this contract's `onlySelf` functions.
   184	    function propose(bytes calldata action) external notLocked returns (bytes32 hash) {
   185	        if (msg.sender != owner) revert NotOwner();
